  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "The procedure contained a legacy issue in which a series of procedure revisions performed in 2010-2012 replaced procedure steps with informational notes. This resulted in incomplete setup of the speed switches, which caused the observed delays in actuation. In addition, the scope of post-maintenance testing guidance specified in the procedure was inadequate to identify a speed switch with an incomplete setup.",
    "cause_code": "D",
    "category": "Defective Procedure",
    "theme": "legacy procedure defect converting directive steps to informational notes, compounded by inadequate post-maintenance test scope",
    "provisional": false
  },
